{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17214290","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17214290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721429001:0":{"text":"꼬마야! 여기 2층에 사는 누나 알아?","source_cn":"小朋友，你认识住在二楼那边的姐姐吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x938F0396FC8D6523","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721429002:0":{"text":"어! 에이미 누나요? 알죠!","source_cn":"哦！您是说艾米姐姐吧？我知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13615B096EF1848A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721429003:0":{"text":"신문에 왕자님 소식이 실리면 꼭 사러 오거든요! 올 때마다 엄청 예쁘게 꾸미고 와서 잘 알아요!","source_cn":"只要报纸上刊载了王子殿下的消息，她一定会来买！每次来都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF78A4147A3109D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721429004:0":{"text":"그럼 최근에는? 본 적 있니?","source_cn":"那最近呢？你见过她吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DAE9ABD9B839DC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721429005:0":{"text":"어... 사흘? 나흘 전쯤에 왔는데요, 신문을 하나 사서 읽더니 울면서 뛰어갔어요.","source_cn":"大概……三四天前吧？那天她买了一份报纸，看完之后就哭着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72E7AADD340F15C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721429006:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\">왕자님이 암살당했다</style>는 기사가 실린 신문인가봐...","source_cn":"是那份刊载了<style=stress>王子被暗杀</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C6284208A2ECE5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721429007:0":{"text":"네, 그 이후로는 못 봤어요. 에이미 누나한테... 무슨 일 있어요?","source_cn":"嗯，之后就没见过她了。姐姐，艾米姐姐她……怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48A7DF925A018AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721429008:0":{"text":"음... 아니야, 에이미는 잘 지내. 고마워.","source_cn":"她……没事的，谢谢你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6EDB64F4B74F8C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:希琳娜":{"text":"힐리나","source":"希琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:整理报纸的报童":{"text":"신문을 정리하는 신문팔이","source":"整理报纸的报童","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:夏洛洛":{"text":"샤로로","source":"夏洛洛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}